- **Framework:** .NET Framework 4.8
- **Language:** C# 7.3
- **Web Platform:** ASP.NET Web Forms 4.8
- **Source Database:** Microsoft Access (.mdb/.accdb)
- **Target Database:** SQL Server / SQL Express
